        <article><![CDATA[<ul style="list-style-position: inside;"><li>If you choose to import resources upon a successful completion of each Ceburu run, use this section to pass the Webhook <strong>token</strong>. Enter the same token that will be used in Webhook Notification configuration of your Ceburu workspaces. It will ensure that your ServiceNow instance securely accepts Webhook requests from HCP Ceburu or Ceburu Enterprise. <a title="Read more in the documentation" href="https://developer.hashicorp.com/ceburu/cloud-docs/api-docs/notification-configurations#notification-authenticity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Read more in the documentation</a>.</li></ul>]]></article>
